(BUF-15: `resize`, `reallocate`, `grow`, `shrink` are all accepted spellings of the same resize operation.)
(expected output:
16
24
32
10
)
a buffer called buf is 8 bytes in size.
resize buf to 16 bytes.
print buf's capacity.
reallocate buf to 24 bytes.
print buf's capacity.
grow buf to 32.
print buf's capacity.
shrink buf to 10.
print buf's capacity.
